<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="2JN" style="id">2 Johana</book>
  <para style="h">2 Johana</para>
  <para style="toc1">2 Johana</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Johana</para>
  <para style="mt">2 Johana</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Upa chuan Hmeichhe Ṭha Pathian thlan leh a fate, thutaka ka hmangaihte chibai ka bûk e. Keimah chauh pawh ni lovin, thutak hretu dang zawng zawng pawhin an hmangaih a che u;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />thutak, keimahnia chêng chu, kumkhuain kan hnênah a awm dâwn avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thutak leh hmangaihnaah chuan Pa Pathian leh Pa Fapa Isua Krista hnên ata khawngaihna te, zahngaihna te, remna te chu kan hnênah a awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pain thu min pêk anga i fa tute emaw thutaka an awm ka hmuh avângin ka lâwm êm êm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hmeichhe ṭha, thupêk thar ni lovin, a tîr ata kan dawn kha hrilh tûr chein ka ziak a ni: ‘i inhmangaih tawn ang u,’ tiin ka ngên a che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A thupêk ang zêla kan awm hi hmangaihna chu a ni; hei hi a thupêk, a tîr ata in hriat kha a ni, ‘hmangaihnaah in awm reng tûr a ni,’ tih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bumtu tam tak, Isua Krista chu tisa puin a lo kal tih pawm lote khawvêlah an lo chhuak ta a. Chutiang mite chu bumtu leh Krista dodâltute an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />In thawh chhuah sate chân lova in thawh hlawh a kima in hmuh theih zâwk nân, mahni invêng ṭha rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tu pawh Krista zirtîrna thu-a khawsa lova kal khûm chuan Pathian a nei lo. A zirtîrna thu-a khawsa reng chuan Pa leh Fapa a nei kawp a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chu zirtîrna chu keng lova in hnêna lo kal chu tu mahin inah thlentîr suh ula, ṭawngkam ṭha pawhin lo be suh u:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ṭawngkam ṭhaa betu chu a thil sual tihah chuan a tel ve a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />In hnênah thu tam tak sawi tûr nei mah ila, lehkha leh lehkhatuia ziak ka tum lo; kan lâwm a kim theih nân in hnêna lo kala, inhmatawna inbiak ka beisei zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />I laizâwnnu, thlan ni ve bawki faten chibai an bûk a che.
  </para>
</usx>
